      "extract": "First recall the result of Basor and Chen and the main steps of its proof. Theorem 3. For f ∈H1(R) ∩L1(R) we have det(χ[0,R]Wef χ[0,R]) = exp(RcS 1 (f) + cS 2 (f))QS R(f), where cS 1 (f) = bf(0), cS 2 (f) = 1 2 Z R+ x bf(x) bf(−x) dx and QS R(f) = det(χ[R,∞)Wef−We−f+We−f−Wef+χ[R,∞)). Remark 2. We state Theorem 3 under assumptions different from [2] to outline clearer the proof of Theorem 1. The proof consists of",
