      "extract": "Here and below we denote the ideals of trace-class and Hilbert–Schmidt operators by J1 and J2, respectively. For more details of the theory, we refer the reader to [24] and [22]. We let E denote R or R+ = [0, ∞). Definition 1. The operator K on L2(E) is locally trace class if for each bounded measurable subset B of E the operator χBKχB is trace class. Let J loc 1 (L2(E)) denote the space of locally trace-class",
